REASON: All six runs are done with matching budgets, epochs and seeds; their values support the stated arithmetic and cautious interpretation (including waterbirds_final_trustmask_v1_k29_s1_1103_170855_2e3c versus waterbirds_final_teacher_topk_k29_s1_1103_170914_f015).
However, truncated metrics omit per-run selector_sha verification against each job snapshot; the researcher’s table does not establish that match. The required analysis_out decomposition is also absent. [MaskedKD](https://maskedkd.github.io/) and [attention rollout](https://aclanthology.org/2020.acl-main.385/) confirm prior foundations, not novelty. This diagnostic alone establishes no FLOPs-efficiency result.